## Induction Heating sample: half-torus coil + cylindrical workpiece + air
## Required labels: source, sink (sidesets on coil cut faces)
## Blocks: coil, workpiece, air
##
## Geometry:
##   Coil: half-torus (R_major=0.11 m, R_minor=0.01 m)
##   Workpiece: cylinder (R=0.05 m, H=0.06 m) at center
##   Air: sphere (R=0.30 m)
##
## BEM coil-only mode: leave "Workpiece block" empty in GUI
## BEM coil+WP mode: enter "workpiece" in GUI
##
## Usage: Solve -> Radia-NGSolve -> Induction Heating

reset

# === Coil: half-torus ===
create torus major radius 0.11 minor radius 0.01
webcut volume 1 with plane xplane noimprint nomerge
delete volume 2

# === Workpiece: cylinder at center ===
create cylinder height 0.06 radius 0.05

# === Air: sphere ===
create sphere radius 0.30

# Conformal interfaces
imprint all
merge all

# --- Mesh ---
volume 1 scheme tetmesh
volume 1 size auto factor 5
mesh volume 1

volume 3 scheme tetmesh
volume 3 size auto factor 5
mesh volume 3

volume 4 scheme tetmesh
volume 4 size auto factor 3
mesh volume 4

# --- Blocks (materials) ---
block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "coil"
block 2 add volume 3
block 2 name "workpiece"
block 3 add volume 4
block 3 name "air"

# --- Sidesets (boundary conditions) ---
sideset 1 add surface 2
sideset 1 name "source"
sideset 2 add surface 3
sideset 2 name "sink"

# Hide air for visibility
volume 4 visibility off
